| `storage-keys.js` | `makeTrailKeys(prefix, suffixes)` |
| `components/CodeKeypad.svelte` | 4-digit pad |
| `wordle/Game.js` | Five-letter engine (inject answer) |
| `components/ConnectionsBoard.svelte` | Connections grid + seeded board |
| `components/GuessRow.svelte` / `quiz-form.css` | Guess+OK / card-row styles |
| `audio-mix.js` | Layered tracks helpers |
| `puzzle-utils.js` | Storage + `seededRandom` / `seededShuffle` (no `Math.random` at init) |
